# Server-only Accounts read configuration. Never put these values in config.js.
# The installed ~/.cloudflared/config.yml selects this listener's Access hostname.
# Cloudflare validates each assertion at that protected hostname.
# Reuse the existing per-environment IngestDB SUPABASE_URL and SB_SECRET_KEY.
# Reuse existing UK_AQ_MEDIA_ADMIN_URL and UK_AQ_MEDIA_ADMIN_TOKEN.
